  "described": {
    "alt_text": "A bleached photograph of the Flatiron Building wrapped in scaffolding, with a faceless woman walking toward the viewer, a row of blue bike share bikes and a red truck, signed 2023.",
    "description": "A portrait format digital piece on a photograph, signed 2023 at lower right. The Flatiron Building, covered in dark scaffolding, rises at centre against a sky bleached to pale yellow and pink with faint rainbow banding. Older stone buildings flank it. In the foreground a woman in a green top and black shorts walks toward the viewer with a blank cartoon face, a figure in a teal shirt stands at centre with a blank face, and smaller faceless figures stand near a red truck and planters. A row of blue bike share bikes lines the right edge, a red fire truck and a red box truck sit at centre right, and the pavement is tinted pink and yellow. A billboard at left shows a scribbled blank head.",
    "impression": "A tourist photograph of a famous building with the tourists anonymised, so the scaffolded Flatiron becomes the only one with a face. The pastel pavement and rainbow sky make the plaza look like a stage set. Ordinary and slightly surreal, which is the series' recurring mood.",
